{
    "title": "Dwellin: easy home maintenance",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfe0 Discover Dwellin: Your Ultimate Homeownership Companion\r\n\r\nEscape the chaos of home maintenance and unexpected repairs. Dwellin simplifies home ownership by providing modern tools to manage your home, helps you save money and guides you through every stage of your home's journey.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Simplify Home Repairs & Home Maintenance \ud83d\udcc5\r\nStay on top of your maintenance with a custom task calendar and reminders\r\nAccess trusted service pros with ease\r\nStay organized with a comprehensive Home Binder\r\nProtect your home systems & appliances with a secure coverage plan\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 Master Your Home Budget & Save Money \ud83d\udcca\r\nGet a custom annual budget\r\nTrack your annual home maintenance costs\r\nReceive personalized tips to save money\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe1 Take Control of Your Home Inventory \ud83d\udce6\r\nAutomatically pre-fill your home inventory \r\nTrack household items for insurance & home maintenance purposes\r\nStore user manuals, warranties, and receipts for easy access\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0d Lower Your Carbon Footprint & Fight Climate Change \ud83c\udf31\r\nEstimate & compare your household's carbon footprint\r\nReceive tips on reducing your environmental impact\r\nLearn about net zero living & carbon offsets\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12 Privacy & Data Protection You Can Trust \ud83d\udd10\r\nDwellin utilizes public records & AI-generated data to pre-fill home details\r\nDwellin is 100% commitment to protecting your privacy\r\nDwellin will never sell any of your personal information\r\n\r\nWhether you own a house, condo, townhouse, or apartment, Dwellin is here to help you confidently manage your home maintenance and work towards a net zero future. With a personalized roadmap for every homeowner, Dwellin ensures a custom experience tailored to your unique needs. Download Dwellin today and embrace a smarter, sustainable way of living!\r\n\r\nDwellin | Simplify Homeownership | AI-Powered Home Inventory | Home Maintenance | Personalized Roadmap | Sustainable Living Made Easy",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfe0 Discover Dwellin: Your Ultimate Homeownership Companion<br><br>Escape the chaos of home maintenance and unexpected repairs. Dwellin simplifies home ownership by providing modern tools to manage your home, helps you save money and guides you through every stage of your home&#39;s journey.<br><br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Simplify Home Repairs &amp; Home Maintenance \ud83d\udcc5<br>Stay on top of your maintenance with a custom task calendar and reminders<br>Access trusted service pros with ease<br>Stay organized with a comprehensive Home Binder<br>Protect your home systems &amp; appliances with a secure coverage plan<br><br>\ud83d\udcb0 Master Your Home Budget &amp; Save Money \ud83d\udcca<br>Get a custom annual budget<br>Track your annual home maintenance costs<br>Receive personalized tips to save money<br><br>\ud83c\udfe1 Take Control of Your Home Inventory \ud83d\udce6<br>Automatically pre-fill your home inventory <br>Track household items for insurance &amp; home maintenance purposes<br>Store user manuals, warranties, and receipts for easy access<br><br>\ud83c\udf0d Lower Your Carbon Footprint &amp; Fight Climate Change \ud83c\udf31<br>Estimate &amp; compare your household&#39;s carbon footprint<br>Receive tips on reducing your environmental impact<br>Learn about net zero living &amp; carbon offsets<br><br>\ud83d\udd12 Privacy &amp; Data Protection You Can Trust \ud83d\udd10<br>Dwellin utilizes public records &amp; AI-generated data to pre-fill home details<br>Dwellin is 100% commitment to protecting your privacy<br>Dwellin will never sell any of your personal information<br><br>Whether you own a house, condo, townhouse, or apartment, Dwellin is here to help you confidently manage your home maintenance and work towards a net zero future. With a personalized roadmap for every homeowner, Dwellin ensures a custom experience tailored to your unique needs. Download Dwellin today and embrace a smarter, sustainable way of living!<br><br>Dwellin | Simplify Homeownership | AI-Powered Home Inventory | Home Maintenance | Personalized Roadmap | Sustainable Living Made Easy",
